# TinyAssets daemon-only agent interchange secret.
#
# Install this as /etc/tinyassets/agent-interchange.env with owner
# root:tinyassets and mode 0640. deploy/compose.yml injects it only into the
# daemon container; tunnel, logging, and worker containers must not receive it.
#
# Generate at least 32 random bytes and store their canonical single-line
# standard-base64 encoding. Never commit a filled value or reuse an example.
# Production installs the repository secret of the same name.
#
# Rotation: replace the secret and deploy. Image rollback intentionally keeps
# the new key so a rotated-away key is never resurrected. Deleting the
# repository secret only blocks deploys; to revoke safely, rotate and deploy,
# or stop the daemon before removing this protected file.
TINYASSETS_AGENT_INTERCHANGE_HMAC_KEY=
